# Shared model of sections/ (INCLUDEd): one cantilever CBAR on a PBARL and one
# CBEAM on a PBEAML for every beam library type of the format reference, and CBAR on PBARL
# BAR at width over thickness 1, 2, 5, 8, 17 and 50. Each cantilever is 100 mm
# long along x, clamped at its first grid point, with a tip load. Units: mm,
# N, tonne.
IsoMat;1;7.E+4;;0.33;2.7E-9
